source: ASF Jira Server 8.20.10, POST /rest/api/1.0/render (hack/jira-render-evidence.py), captured 2026-08-24
observed: Jira substitutes the token before it pairs any delimiter, so the plus inside the token closes no inserted effect.
-- input.jira --
+(+)+
-- rendered.html --
<p><ins><img class="emoticon" src="/jira/images/icons/emoticons/add.png" height="16" width="16" align="absmiddle" alt="" border="0"/></ins></p>
-- want.md --
<ins>:emoticon[(+)]</ins>
-- warnings.json --
[]
